n {:value "185145"} "1952"] "\n" [:option {:value "185163"} "1956"] "\n" [:option {:value "185211"} "1964"] "\n" [:option {:value "185231"} "1968"] "\n" [:option {:value "185251"} "1972"] "\n" [:option {:value "185281"} "1976"] "\n" [:option {:value "185311"} "1980"] "\n" [:option {:value "185341"} "1984"] "\n" [:option {:value "185371"} "1988"] "\n" [:option {:value "185405"} "1992"] "\n" [:option {:value "185441"} "1996"] "\n" [:option {:value "185477"} "2000"] "\n" [:option {:value "185523"} "2004"] "\n" [:option {:value "259079"} "2008"] "\n" [:option {:value "310025"} "2012"] "\n" [:option {:value "358406"} "2016"] "\n" [:option {:value "19012164"} "2020"] "\n" [:option {:value "2003685"} "2024"]] [:script {} "$('#other_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#other_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:a {:href "/event_names/268"} "Event type"]] [:h1 {:class "event_title"} "Individual, Open" [:small {}]] [:table {:class "biodata"} [:tbody {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Date"] [:td {} "5 –  6 September 1960 — 8:00"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Status"] [:td {} "Olympic"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Location"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/venues/423"} "Piazza di Siena, Villa Borghese, Roma"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Participants"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/events/185186"} "17 from 10 countries"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Format"] [:td {:colspan "2"} "Two rounds, total score to determine placement."]]]] [:div {:class "description"} [:p {} "Because of the judging controversies in 1956 dressage, several rules were changed for 1960, as follows: 1) only two riders per country; 2) no team competition; 3) Grand Prix performances to be discussed among the judges before a final verdict; 4) the ride-off performances to be filmed and the film reviewed for a length of time; 5) judges to be selected only from countries with no medal contenders; and 6) scores would be given on the scale of 0 – 10 instead of 0 – 6. Because of the length of time to review the films and the judges’ discussions, the final results were not announced until three days after the competition ended."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The individual dressage was also different as the original 17 competitors rode a preliminary round, with the top five riders advancing to a final round. The top five places were determined by the combined score of the preliminary and final rounds. The two-time defending champion, Sweden’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/12678"} "Henri Saint Cyr"] " was back and made it to the final round, but would eventually place only fourth. Soviet " [:a {:href "/athletes/11963"} "Sergey Filatov"] " went off third in the final, and posted the highest final round score. He had also led the qualifying and thus won the gold medal quite easily. " [:a {:href "/athletes/12487"} "Josef Neckermann"] " was second after qualifying, but placed fourth in the final and dropped back to the bronze medal position, trailing " [:a {:href "/athletes/11966"} "Gustav Fischer"] ", who had the second best final round. American " [:a {:href "/athletes/11329"} "Patricia Galvin"] " had won the recent Grand Prix de Aachen and came in as one of the favorites, but placed sixth in qualifying and just missed the final."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "Horse"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Points"] [:th {} "Qualifying"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/11963"} "Sergey Filatov"]] [:td {} [:i {} [:a {:href "/horses/10"} "Absent"]]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/URS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/URS.png"}] "URS"]] [:td {} "2,144"] [:td {} "1,074 (1)"] [:td {} "1,070 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/11966"} "Gustav Fischer"]] [:td {} [:i {} [:a {:href "/horses/2639"} "Wald"]]] [:td {} [